  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6002.12 “State fire code” means “New Hampshire fire code” or “state fire code” as defined in RSA 153:1, VI-a.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 6000) #13094, eff 8-25-20; ss by #14320, eff 7-16-25, EXPIRES: 7-16-35",
